  ${rep ? `<p>Committed: ${rep.committedPoints} · Completed: ${rep.completedPoints} pts / ${rep.completedIssues} issues · Carried over: ${rep.carriedOver}</p>${burndownSvg(rep.burndown)}` : '<p>No sprints.</p>'}</div>
